## 🚀 部署架构

### 推荐部署架构

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "客户端层"
        Web[Web 浏览器]
        Mobile[移动应用]
    end
    
    subgraph "负载均衡层"
        LB[Nginx/Load Balancer]
    end
    
    subgraph "应用层"
        App1[Helios 实例 1]
        App2[Helios 实例 2]
        App3[Helios 实例 N]
    end
    
    subgraph "数据层"
        DB[(PostgreSQL 主库)]
        DBSlave[(PostgreSQL 从库)]
        Redis[(Redis 缓存)]
    end
    
    Web --> LB
    Mobile --> LB
    LB --> App1
    LB --> App2
    LB --> App3
    
    App1 --> DB
    App2 --> DB
    App3 --> DB
    
    App1 --> Redis
    App2 --> Redis
    App3 --> Redis
    
    DB --> DBSlave
```

### 环境配置

**开发环境**:
```bash
DATABASE_HOST=localhost
DATABASE_PORT=5432
DATABASE_USER=helios_dev
DATABASE_NAME=helios_dev
JWT_SECRET=dev_secret_key
```

**生产环境**:
```bash
DATABASE_HOST=prod-db.example.com
DATABASE_PORT=5432
DATABASE_USER=helios_prod
DATABASE_NAME=helios_prod
JWT_SECRET=<strong_random_secret>
```

